      "bytes": 118620,
      "seconds": 12.601,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band2-010-034.mp3",
      "subtitle": "我希望友希那能幸福，所以一直在她身边守着她。\n总担心她可能会走偏，\n所以一直注意着她"
    },
    {
      "slug": "lisa",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 23,
      "speaker": 23,
      "text": "我或许也和摩卡有些相似。\n……正因为如此吧，我不希望摩卡变得和我一样",
      "cue": "band2-010-036",
      "storyId": "30",
      "scenario": "band2-010",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/002_rip/Scenarioband2-010.asset",
